%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec4ba6a512adabf4b8a74985cb2f4d14, type: 3}
  m_Name: MuratIntroDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptedDialogue
  isForced: 1
  nodes:
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Merhaba, officer! Grim day, no? My papers, my ID, and this lucky chestnut. Murat Celik, trader, mostly textiles.
    animationTrigger: TalkSmile
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    fontOverride: {fileID: 0}
    playLaughSfx: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: I've been a travelling merchant for thirty years. Before that, my father was one. The bazaar never fully closes.
    animationTrigger: TalkSmile
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    fontOverride: {fileID: 0}
    playLaughSfx: 0
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: Are people still trading?
      npcResponse: More than ever! Less silk, more batteries. But the instinct to barter, that's very human.
      animationTrigger: TalkSmile
      playLaughSfx: 0
    - playerChoiceText: Isn't it dangerous to travel right now?
      npcResponse: Everything's dangerous! The dangerous roads and the safe ones both lead somewhere interesting.
      animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
      playLaughSfx: 0
  - type: 0
    npcLine: I live with my son and his family. Three grandchildren, very noisy, the best thing about a house.
    animationTrigger: TalkSmile
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    fontOverride: {fileID: 0}
    playLaughSfx: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: You seem like a man who appreciates a steady thing. This checkpoint is one too. My permit, December expiry.
    animationTrigger: TalkSmile
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    fontOverride: {fileID: 0}
    playLaughSfx: 0
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: Is the tea house still open?
      npcResponse: It was, yesterday anyway! Samuil's black tea is very strong. Some things don't end.
      animationTrigger: TalkSmile
      playLaughSfx: 0
    - playerChoiceText: You seem very calm about all this.
      npcResponse: I've seen three market crashes, two floods, and one very aggressive goat. Perspective is everything.
      animationTrigger: TalkSmile
      playLaughSfx: 0
